    "type": "post",
    "title": "Etherium",
    "text": "Trying to post more drawings/sketches on instagram, if you're interested: instagram.com/saunders_kai/\n\nWoops, it's been awhile, since I've posted something here \n\nIt's been a pretty crazy year on placement. I'm actually studying product/industrial design and working at a design consultancy 5 days a week made me feel pretty burnt out creatively. It was definitely hard to motivate myself to do anything after work. Although, that's not to say I haven't done any paintings! In fact I've done quite a few just I haven't managed to bring them to completion, so I hope to bring the last 10% to each and show them to you guys.\n\nThis one was just done as a gift for a friends 21st! Definitely had fun with looser more painterly brushstrokes. Wanted something colourful and as I progressed through this one, it became more inspired by Ferdinand Ladera's landscapes (Who is awesome by the way - totally check him out if you've not heard of him.)\n\nHope everyone is doing well,\n\nKai",
    "url": "https://www.deviantart.com/kaisaunders/art/Etherium-559711173",
